    <string name="cp_about_body">Independent Apple CarPlay receiver built into Qonecta Unit CORE for Android automotive head units. Works via USB Cable or wirelessly with local authentication — no external dongle required.\n\nNot an Apple Inc. certified product.</string>
    <string name="cp_about_oss_title">Open source &amp; notices</string>
    <string name="cp_about_oss_body">Receiver engine based on xcertplay (GPL-3.0) integrated into Qonecta Unit CORE (AGPL-3.0).\n\nIncludes AndroidX, Bouncy Castle, JmDNS and SLF4J.\n\nCarPlay and the CarPlay icon are trademarks of Apple Inc.</string>
